  "vibe": "Near-black court (#101014) with an acid volt green (#d4f24b) and a flame orange (#ff5a36), set in Archivo Black at its heaviest. The backdrop is a drop-day scoreboard: four volt speed streaks tear across the upper third at different weights, a flame ball bounces the full width on a stitched ink seam, a flame zigzag runs the floor like tread, and a hollow chalk two-digit counter ticks up in the corner. Statement beats invert to a solid volt wall with ink type — a shout, not a caption. The camera is the hardest here: 5° skew, a spin, a drop, bouncy easing, titles streaking in. It owns a keyboard-driven checkout cursor, popping notifications, a swipe carousel and a claim bar. Montage tiles sit dead straight. Best for sneaker drops, streetwear releases and anything with a queue.",
